{"server":"cn","storyId":"act45side_level_act45side_04_end","groupId":"act45side","stageId":"act45side_04","title":"名为客房区的迷宫","storyCode":"SS-4","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act45side/level_act45side_04_end.txt","sourceHash":"707fd9aab125e0d6c7eae4238536893351dca2dc518a52576f8cc01ea9d74c4f","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"在艾雅法拉的鼓励下，初华终于决定离开小岛，去寻找祥子。祥子也终于到达了初华的住处，然而两人却阴差阳错地错过了。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"当重复的事情做了无数次，人总会丧失对其的感知。\n当重复的一天度过了无数遍，人便会陷入这个循环之中。\n无从自觉，无法自拔。\n就像一个漫长的、无尽的、无解的梦一样。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_hotel"},{"type":"narration","text":"伴随着山中羽兽的啼鸣，每天清晨从床上自然地苏醒。\n倘若想睡个懒觉，也不会有人催促，把头重新埋进被子里就好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"34_g6_noblelivingroom"},{"type":"narration","text":"收拾好被子和床铺，在厨房简单地做一顿早餐。\n煎蛋，面包，牛奶......\n想吃什么，想喝什么，全凭自己的心意。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ltroom"},{"type":"narration","text":"一个人坐在钢琴旁，按下一个琴键，将未调的琴弦一点点调成正确的音调。不知过了多久，再调下一根琴弦。\n等到调完最后一根琴弦，第一根琴弦的音调又变得不准。\n于是，如此反复。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"一个人躺在盛夏的草地上，看着一览无余的星空。\n她知道，即使星星的位置看起来和昨天并无区别，但其实它们一直在永不停歇地变化。\n两颗现在相邻的星星，即使被人们赋予意义，在千万年后，也会变得无比遥远，毫无瓜葛。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"就和人与人之间的关系一样。\n今天，她也没有回来。\n在渺无人烟的小岛，仅凭脑海中微弱的记忆，构建一个不可确信的梦。\n囿于记忆的牢笼，如同人偶一般。\n执念与悲伤填充着身体，膨胀，膨胀。\n却动弹不得。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"34_g6_noblelivingroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三角初华","speakerId":"avg_4184_dolris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一开始，我以为她只是突发奇想，去附近散了散步。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三角初华","speakerId":"avg_4184_dolris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"后来，我从码头工人的口中得知，她那天独自登上了离岛的航船......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾雅法拉","speakerId":"avg_180_amgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你为什么不去找她呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三角初华","speakerId":"avg_4184_dolris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这样的一天实在有过太多太多次，多到我不能确认它究竟是否真实。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三角初华","speakerId":"avg_4184_dolris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......我已经想不起她的模样，也记不起她的名字了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三角初华","speakerId":"avg_4184_dolris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也许这就是我的归宿......在这静静地等待。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"等待她的归来，抑或是我的死亡。\n悲伤的源泉终有一天会干涸，没有更多的眼泪，便不会再哭泣了。\n这样无人关心的角落，就是我最好的归宿。\n“不行！”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三角初华","speakerId":"avg_4184_dolris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾雅法拉","speakerId":"avg_180_amgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"初华小姐，你在哭，说明你还不想放弃，对吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾雅法拉","speakerId":"avg_180_amgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这不是你想要的结局，对吧？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾雅法拉","speakerId":"avg_180_amgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至少......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾雅法拉","speakerId":"avg_180_amgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至少，应该站在她的面前，表达自己的想法吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三角初华","speakerId":"avg_4184_dolris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾雅法拉","speakerId":"avg_180_amgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我能听出来的话，她一定也能明白你的心意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾雅法拉","speakerId":"avg_180_amgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用尽全力呐喊，又怎么能传达给她呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾雅法拉","speakerId":"avg_180_amgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"连我都能听到你的声音，她肯定也可以的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三角初华","speakerId":"avg_4184_dolris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......可是你的听力状况，我不能留下你一个人——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾雅法拉","speakerId":"avg_180_amgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再怎么说，我也是接受过罗德岛训练的干员，你就放心好啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾雅法拉","speakerId":"avg_180_amgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"作为本就是萍水相逢的人，初华小姐，你已经为我做了很多事了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾雅法拉","speakerId":"avg_180_amgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你该问问自己的内心——现在到底想要做什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三角初华","speakerId":"avg_4184_dolris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小声）我想找到她......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三角初华","speakerId":"avg_4184_dolris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......没什么。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾雅法拉","speakerId":"avg_180_amgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"初华小姐，我看得懂唇语哦。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"“看吧，你已无路可逃”\n“将逐渐虚弱的你，紧紧关住——”\n“你知晓我渴望......”\n“我渴望......我渴望......”\n“我如此渴望着你......”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"41_g5_siestaunbuiltland_d"},{"type":"narration","text":"当初华察觉到时，她已经在全力地奔跑了。\n她感到胸腔前所未有地炙热，这种感觉甚至让她有些头晕目眩。\n而最后的一丝理智，还在不断地质问着她——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"连名字都记不清，连面貌都想不起......\n你又如何能在茫茫人海里找到她的身影？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三角初华","speakerId":"avg_4184_dolris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是我想见到她！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三角初华","speakerId":"avg_4184_dolris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"无论如何，我都想再次见到她！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"她的声音先她一步，朝心中的方向飞去。\n而她，正奋力地朝自己声音的方向奔去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"34_g6_noblelivingroom"},{"type":"narration","text":"祥子顺利来到了别墅，这里的一切都跟莫菲丝让她看到的一模一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"初华——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一模一样的格局，一模一样的摆件......就连架子上的书都完全一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"地面上一尘不染，厨房里摆满了过量的餐具，还有一张能坐下十多人的长桌。\n祥子无法想象初华一人生活于此的场景。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然是做梦，那就把痛苦的部分丢得一干二净啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"一定是她觉得，这里对于你们两人来说，都很重要吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾雅法拉","speakerId":"avg_180_amgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你就是这栋别墅的主人吧......初华小姐刚刚离开这。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......她去哪里了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾雅法拉","speakerId":"avg_180_amgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她终于认清了自己的内心，决心去找你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"65_g3_islandharbor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"热心的船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1000_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你要坐船吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三角初华","speakerId":"avg_4184_dolris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，我想买张离岛的船票。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"热心的船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1000_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，那你得等一会，我还在等另一个乘客。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"热心的船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1000_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那个姑娘怎么还没回来呢......希望她已经找着人了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三角初华","speakerId":"avg_4184_dolris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没关系的，我可以等......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"初华说到一半，硬生生地将下半句话咽了回去。好在船夫并没有察觉她的异样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"热心的船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1000_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，夜晚海上浪大雾浓，行船不安全。我得为你们的安全着想啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"热心的船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1000_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喏，你听信号塔发的信号，那家伙在催我们走呢。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"65_i05_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三角初华","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"塔上那个人，他在挥舞旗子......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"热心的船夫","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呵，那老酒鬼就指着我每月给他带的啤酒过活。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"热心的船夫","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“一路平安，别忘记了——我的啤酒。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"热心的船夫","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哼，忘记谁的东西，也不能忘记他的那箱美酒啊！"},{"type":"narration","text":"船夫说完，一个箭步登上了船。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"由海面吹来的风，将汽笛声带去小岛的每一个地方。\n看着这座寄托了美好和痛苦的小岛，初华有太多话想倾诉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三角初华","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......别忘记我。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"不可能忘记的吧。\n我们从儿时就一起生活在这里。\n我相信，我们一定会再次相见——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"初华——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呼......呼......呼......咳咳咳......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"65_i05_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"初华——初华——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"祥子的声音已经沙哑。\n海浪一遍遍拍打着海岸，没有回声。\n返航的船已经驶离。\n现在，只留她一人独守于此。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"65_g4_islandharbor_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等待了无数个日夜的少女，终于决心启程寻找自己的伙伴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没想到却在最后一刻错过......啧啧啧，好可惜哟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说实话，我没想到她会选择离开。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在我给她预设的结局里，她应该会忘掉关于你的一切，然后在这度过安逸无忧的一生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过现在看来，我有点低估你对她的影响了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我得承认，这局我们平手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可惜的是，以那艘航船的速度，她就快要遇到海难了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为你们建造这整个岛已经够累了，难道还要我把整个泰拉造出来，让你们的苦情戏码在整片大地上一遍遍地上演？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"船马上要开到梦境的边际了，然后她就会落入下一次的梦境。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一次次循环，一次次重置。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她终会忘记你的存在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不行，我要想办法追上她——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"已经没有时间了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"祥子感到自己脚下一阵冰凉，不知何时，海水已经漫过脚踝。\n大海与天空的连接处已经被阴云笼罩，其中时不时闪着刺眼的光芒。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"初华——！"},{"type":"narration","text":"海水像疯了一样不断地上涨，祥子感到有什么正在将自己往深渊里拖拽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"初华——等着我！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"49_g12_diving"},{"type":"narration","text":"幽暗，冰冷，窒息。\n海水压迫着鼓膜，残存在胸腔中的氧气渐渐稀薄，就和头顶越来越微弱的光一样。\n视线愈发模糊，咸苦的海水从无法紧闭的嘴中涌入，试图侵占最后的意识。\n就这样，就这样，一直下坠。\n直到海底，暗无天日之处。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"“祥......”\n“祥......祥......”\n一个声音，正从无法辨听的方向靠近。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"这是哪？\n是谁在叫我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"快......快......快醒醒......"},{"type":"narration","text":"熟悉的声音，许久未闻的声音。\n冰冷潮湿的海底已经消失得无影无踪，取而代之的是干燥的地面，还有四处纷飞的沙尘。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是谁......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"65_i06"},{"type":"narration","text":"祥子努力睁开双眼，一缕浅色的头发映入眼帘。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"若叶睦","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"祥，你还好吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......睦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"若叶睦","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，我在。"},{"type":"narration","text":"再简单不过的一句话，却让祥子的眼泪夺眶而出。\n她确信不是飞沙的缘故，因为只有她自己知道，此刻她的内心有多么无助。\n她已无暇顾及自己一开口便会哽咽，她只想抓住唯一的那根稻草。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"睦......我......该怎么办......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
